          "**Fried phenotype (2001)**: unintentional weight loss **4.5 kg or 5% in a year**, self-reported **exhaustion**, **weak grip** (lowest 20%), **slow gait** (slowest 20%), **low physical activity** - **3 or more of 5 frail, 1-2 pre-frail, 0 robust**. [Harrison 22e]",
